.TH MIRNA 1 2000-1月 "blastn_filter" "blastn_filter"
.SH NAME
blastn_filter \- 对 blastn 预筛结果做 psRNATarget 风格的打分过滤。
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fIblastn_filter(\fBblastn\fR as any, 
\fBevalueCutoff\fR as double = 1000, 
\fBmaxExpectation\fR as double = 5, 
\fBminHitLength\fR as integer = 17, 
\fBseedStart\fR as integer = 2, 
\fBseedEnd\fR as integer = 13, 
\fBmaxSeedMm\fR as integer = 2, 
\fBmaxTotalMm\fR as integer = 8, 
\fBmaxGu\fR as integer = 7, 
\fBverbose\fR as boolean = FALSE, 
[\fB<Environment>\fR]);\fR
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
对 blastn 预筛结果做 psRNATarget 风格的打分过滤。
.PP
.SH OPTIONS
.PP
\fBblastn\fB \fR\- 由 \fBparse_blastn\fR 或 \fBmirna_blastn\fR 解析出的 HSP 集合。. 
.PP
.PP
\fBevalueCutoff\fB \fR\- 
 BLAST e-value 预筛阈值（与 blastn 命令行 -evalue 同量级）。
 注意它与 \fBmaxExpectation\fR 量纲不同：前者是 BLAST 统计显著性，后者是打分期望值。
. 
.PP
.PP
\fBmaxExpectation\fB \fR\- psRNATarget 期望分上限（越低越好）。. 
.PP
.PP
\fBminHitLength\fB \fR\- 最小 HSP 长度。. 
.PP
.SH SEE ALSO
miRNA
